---
// The same long form as nested function calls: each ring wraps the word it was given.
---
<figure class="illus il-nest">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 480 295" role="img" aria-labelledby="nest-art-t">
    <title id="nest-art-t">Nested function calls, inside out. 食べる is wrapped by causative to give 食べさせる, then passive to give 食べさせられる, then tai to give 食べさせられたい, then neg to give 食べさせられたくない, then past to give 食べさせられたくなかった.</title>
    <rect class="il-blk type-i-adj" x="8" y="8" width="464" height="279" rx="14" />
    <text class="il-m il-l il-ac" x="20" y="27">past</text>
    <text class="il-t il-r" x="460" y="27">食べさせられたくなかった</text>
    <rect class="il-blk type-i-adj" x="22" y="44" width="436" height="234" rx="12.5" />
    <text class="il-m il-l il-ac" x="34" y="63">neg</text>
    <text class="il-t il-r" x="446" y="63">食べさせられたくない</text>
    <rect class="il-blk type-i-adj" x="36" y="80" width="408" height="189" rx="11" />
    <text class="il-m il-l il-ac" x="48" y="99">tai</text>
    <text class="il-t il-r" x="432" y="99">食べさせられたい</text>
    <rect class="il-blk type-verb" x="50" y="116" width="380" height="144" rx="9.5" />
    <text class="il-m il-l il-ac" x="62" y="135">passive</text>
    <text class="il-t il-r" x="418" y="135">食べさせられる</text>
    <rect class="il-blk type-verb" x="64" y="152" width="352" height="99" rx="8" />
    <text class="il-m il-l il-ac" x="76" y="171">causative</text>
    <text class="il-t il-r" x="404" y="171">食べさせる</text>
    <rect class="il-blk type-verb" x="185" y="196" width="110" height="46" rx="9" />
    <text class="il-t" x="240" y="219.0">食べる</text>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>Read from the inside out. Each function wraps the word it is given and returns a new word.</figcaption>
</figure>
